  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">注意：该项目旨在供 BrPacks 制作的整合包使用，并不打算单独游玩，因为其中没有可用的合成表。如果您希望在自己的整合包中使用它，请随意创建您的合成表，我们明确授权免费使用此模组（DivineArmament），无论其是否具有盈利目的。（英文）</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">注意：此项目专为 BrPacks 制作的整合包设计，并非用于单人游戏，因为其中未提供合成表。如果您希望在您的整合包中使用它，请自行创建合成表。我们明确授权免费使用此模组（DivineArmament），无论是否以营利为目的。（葡萄牙语）&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;border:0px solid #000000;width:601.7px\"><img style=\"width:601.70px;margin-left:0.00px\" src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/aNMmEvkPL5KP8VC8sIOOhBpaX_ANyo3-y3vObk0AYYNE7IjCYEBJrQ1WCP70y_3bOg4ohcOEUQP6kbz9Y7_JsaCn2gkc5hm8C03q9rYexAQc9HB8oP3c3K47C9iPRIuBr_EjqfKy\" alt=\"\"></span></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">信息 | 資訊</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">哈迪斯之剑：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">这把剑获得了死神的力量，帮助你将任何灵魂带到这里！</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Esta espada obtém o poder do deus da morte e ajuda você a trazer qualquer alma para cá!</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/804382722671902730/804687904348569641/unknown.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"449\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">米约尼尔（Mjonir）：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">这件武器无需多言！成为雷神。借助它，您可以向任意方向飞跃数米，瞬间击杀实体并召唤闪电！</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Esta arma dispensa apresentações! Torne-se o deus do trovão. Com ele você pode se lançar metros de distância em qualquer direção, matar entidades instantaneamente e lançar raios!</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/804382722671902730/804687936431849482/unknown.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"449\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">护甲 | 盔甲：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">这部分已经可用，但仍缺乏文档说明！</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Esta já está disponível, porém ainda carece de documentação!</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/804382722671902730/804687879375683634/unknown.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"449\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">额外说明 | 補充說明</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp;&nbsp;-本项目基于 Mcreator 构建：</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://mcreator.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">https://mcreator.net/</span></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp;&nbsp;-Este projeto foi feito com Mcreator: <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcreator.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://mcreator.net/</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
